  "content": "<h1>Alpha测试阶段</h1>\n<p>本项目处于Alpha阶段，意味着它还不够稳定，缺少大量计划中的内容，并且在开发过程中会有重大机制调整。</p>\n<p>如需更稳定的替代方案，请使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lexicon模组</a>。</p>\n\n<h1>知识典籍</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/630b43b428692d14112f7921748338f466a1c2ec.png\" alt=\"首页展示图\"></p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knowlogy/files/all?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/fabric/compact-supports.svg\" alt=\"支持Fabric\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knowlogy/files/all?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/neoforge/compact-supports.svg\" alt=\"支持NeoForge\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fknowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/V4OTaHaq?style=flat&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=下载量&amp;labelColor=03190a&amp;color=1e1e1e\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/944409?style=flat&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=下载量&amp;labelColor=241009&amp;color=1e1e1e\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p>本模组新增<strong>知识典籍</strong>，可显示来自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Wiki</a>的信息，并根据玩家成就进度逐步解锁内容。</p>\n<p>旨在通过游戏进程控制信息呈现节奏，避免在游戏初期就用大量文本或冗长清单淹没玩家，同时确保Wiki的丰富文档能在适当时机发挥作用。</p>\n\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/owo-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/owo-lib/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"需要owo Lib\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lavender-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/lavender/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"需要Lavender\"></a>\n</p>\n<h3>仅Fabric版本需要：</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/fabric-api/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"需要Fabric API\"></a></p>\n<h3>仅NeoForge版本需要：</h3>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/sinytra-connector/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"需要Sinytra连接器\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgified-fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/forgified-fabric-api/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"需要Forgified Fabric API\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<h2>命名由来</h2>\n<p>结合了用于解锁配方的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fKnowledge_Book\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">知识之书</a>和《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMinecraft_Legends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的世界：传奇</a>》中的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMinecraft_Legends%253aKnowledge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">知识宿主</a>，取<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fKnowledge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Know</a>（知识）与<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252f-logy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">-logy</a>（学科）组合，寓意这本典籍不仅能展示配方，更是对游戏知识的系统性研究。</p>\n\n<h2>背景设定</h2>\n<p>由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMinecraft_Legends%253aKnowledge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">知识宿主</a>创造的魔法器物，能够从环境中汲取知识并与阅读者分享。</p>\n\n<h2>扩展性</h2>\n<p>内容通过模组内置的资源包添加，并按游戏版本划分。任何人都可以通过资源包扩展或修改页面与分类。</p>\n\n<h2>常见问题</h2>\n<h3>如何获取典籍？</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li>首次放置工作台时自动获得（触发成就时）；</li>\n    <li>用书和附魔之瓶任意摆放合成；</li>\n    <li>在创造模式\"工具与实用物品\"栏查找；</li>\n    <li>或使用指令<code>/get-lavender-book knowlogy:knowlogy_book</code>或<code>/give @s knowlogy:knowlogy_book</code>（后者仅限Fabric）。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>这是另一个配方查看器吗？</h3>\n<p>不是。本模组重点展示物品间的关联性，并解释游戏机制原理。建议配合<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>使用，这些模组会自动显示配方而无需手动添加。</p>\n\n<h3>典籍空白无内容</h3>\n<p>请检查资源包列表，确保名称含\"Knowlogy\"且图标为书本的内置资源包已启用。这些资源包默认启用，但若资源加载出错可能被禁用。</p>\n\n<h3>NeoForge | 缺少Lavender依赖</h3>\n<p>NeoForge版本需要通过<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra连接器</a>运行原属Fabric的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lavender-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lavender</a>模组。启动器不会自动下载Lavender，需手动在Fabric模组分类中搜索安装。</p>\n\n<h3>NeoForge | 典籍无反应</h3>\n<p>请通过成就、合成配方或指令<code>/get-lavender-book knowlogy:knowlogy_book</code>获取。直接通过EMI/JEI获取的<code>knowlogy:knowlogy_book</code>物品在NeoForge上无效。</p>\n\n<h2>支持项目</h2>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/donate/kofi-singular/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi赞助\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fknowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/translate/crowdin/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin翻译\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<h2>版权声明</h2>\n<p>部分图片取自Wiki，版权归属Wiki贡献者或Mojang Studios所有。</p>",
